'''HYAKUTARO''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 4.3 Update|Version 4.3]] and can be unlocked when beating any stage in [[Metal Slug Collaboration Event#Metal Slug Defense|Metal Slug Defense]] or [[Metal Slug Collaboration Event#Super Metal Slug Defense|Super Metal Slug Defense]] during the [[Metal Slug Collaboration Event]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 214
|rarity = RR
|name1 = HYAKUTARO
|name2 = HYAKUTARO CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''HYAKUTARO CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
This unit is essentially an even worse version of pre-[[True Form]] [[Pogo Cat (Rare Cat)|Pogo Cat]]. Not only does he have an even higher cost, but he also has two more problems: he has a slightly higher range, meaning he will struggle to protect [[:Category:Melee-class Cats|Melee]]-ranged Cats, and he also has a 4.5 second recharge—even more than [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Rocker Cat]]'s recharge! Because of these reasons, most Cats will do his job better as a meatshield.

{{Job|Classification = Meatshield & User Rank Dump}}

